  "content": "<p data-pid=\"BAUfqmPS\">Gemini 4 Argon 已经对 Thoughts Memo 了如指掌了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-4e28a4c905a1c2f2054bf307e5e7f7af_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1472\" data-rawheight=\"2178\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4e28a4c905a1c2f2054bf307e5e7f7af\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1472\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4e28a4c905a1c2f2054bf307e5e7f7af_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1472&#39; height=&#39;2178&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1472\" data-rawheight=\"2178\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-4e28a4c905a1c2f2054bf307e5e7f7af\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1472\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4e28a4c905a1c2f2054bf307e5e7f7af_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-4e28a4c905a1c2f2054bf307e5e7f7af_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-fbd3879fe60163dc9eff7af99358f982_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1472\" data-rawheight=\"2178\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-fbd3879fe60163dc9eff7af99358f982\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1472\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fbd3879fe60163dc9eff7af99358f982_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1472&#39; height=&#39;2178&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1472\" data-rawheight=\"2178\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-fbd3879fe60163dc9eff7af99358f982\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1472\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fbd3879fe60163dc9eff7af99358f982_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-fbd3879fe60163dc9eff7af99358f982_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7199ac738eb7e4f257a788eca0fd2cef_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1472\" data-rawheight=\"1414\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-7199ac738eb7e4f257a788eca0fd2cef\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1472\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7199ac738eb7e4f257a788eca0fd2cef_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1472&#39; height=&#39;1414&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1472\" data-rawheight=\"1414\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-7199ac738eb7e4f257a788eca0fd2cef\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1472\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7199ac738eb7e4f257a788eca0fd2cef_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7199ac738eb7e4f257a788eca0fd2cef_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"yMvnZIVP\">有可能 Gemini 4 Agron 的训练集里包含了 Thoughts Memo 的知乎备份：<a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/90221\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_gallery\" class=\"internal\">AI Works - 人人都是 Thoughts Memo - 知乎</a>，直接大记忆术发动了。</p><p data-pid=\"fH4xlmE3\">我还让它扮演 Thoughts Memo 回答了几个知乎问题，不开联网，也不提供任何语料或者系统提示词……有点恐怖谷效应了：</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-text\">请你扮演 Thoughts Memo 回答知乎问题：多家高校家长吐槽大学课太少，担心孩子没课时睡懒觉，你怎么看待这件事？\n\n问题补充：近期，杭州一位大学新生家长拿到课表后吐槽大学排课太少，担心儿子没课时睡懒觉。多位大一新生受访时表示，没课的时段会自主安排去图书馆自修、备考或探索城市。新生们认为大学学习不仅靠上课，更多在于自主规划，家长应学会放手。‌‌</code></pre></div><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-04192f14d697348fb78b4c18d0bdbc6a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-04192f14d697348fb78b4c18d0bdbc6a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-04192f14d697348fb78b4c18d0bdbc6a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1470&#39; height=&#39;1852&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-04192f14d697348fb78b4c18d0bdbc6a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-04192f14d697348fb78b4c18d0bdbc6a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-04192f14d697348fb78b4c18d0bdbc6a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-882079b1aaae8ffbe816b1fa72bc0462_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-882079b1aaae8ffbe816b1fa72bc0462\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-882079b1aaae8ffbe816b1fa72bc0462_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1470&#39; height=&#39;1852&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-882079b1aaae8ffbe816b1fa72bc0462\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-882079b1aaae8ffbe816b1fa72bc0462_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-882079b1aaae8ffbe816b1fa72bc0462_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-text\">请你扮演 Thoughts Memo 回答知乎问题：中国的应试教育真的很糟糕吗？\n\n问题补充：如题，我是一名高中理科生，我认为学习理科就是应该将所学知识都运用到实际生活中去，这样才有学习的价值（不包括那些什么天文学等对于一般人来说如此遥远的学科）。所以我学习理科一般都是那种死死地抓住问题不放，一定要弄清原理的那种，不然就不会写。而我的同学们则认为在这种教育的制度下，像真正探求在高中是不可能的，目前任务就是考大学，就是是死记硬背都好，原理什么的等大学之后再深究。可是这样对吗？</code></pre></div><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b62c36e04bb107df778d00b8afae565f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-b62c36e04bb107df778d00b8afae565f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b62c36e04bb107df778d00b8afae565f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1470&#39; height=&#39;1852&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-b62c36e04bb107df778d00b8afae565f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b62c36e04bb107df778d00b8afae565f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b62c36e04bb107df778d00b8afae565f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3244ed2c5ff50c2c5d9a371dc8e27b4f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-3244ed2c5ff50c2c5d9a371dc8e27b4f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3244ed2c5ff50c2c5d9a371dc8e27b4f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1470&#39; height=&#39;1852&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1852\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-3244ed2c5ff50c2c5d9a371dc8e27b4f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3244ed2c5ff50c2c5d9a371dc8e27b4f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3244ed2c5ff50c2c5d9a371dc8e27b4f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-fd848afdbc8dc35b52139e6903d7d032_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1240\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-fd848afdbc8dc35b52139e6903d7d032\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fd848afdbc8dc35b52139e6903d7d032_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1470&#39; height=&#39;1240&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"1470\" data-rawheight=\"1240\" data-size=\"normal\" data-caption=\"\" data-original-token=\"v2-fd848afdbc8dc35b52139e6903d7d032\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1470\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fd848afdbc8dc35b52139e6903d7d032_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-fd848afdbc8dc35b52139e6903d7d032_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ns1EfuVh\">这下是真的赛博永生了。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"_yUeUUNU\">相关回答：</p><a data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2093454112922912690/answer/2093765968375948817\" data-draft-title=\"如何评价10月13日正式推出的Gemini 4 Argon？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c5b268334ab1610fa405814a71b10a9c.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">如何评价10月13日正式推出的Gemini 4 Argon？</a><p></p>",
