    "detail": "<p>在不联网、不借助外部知识库的情况下，大语言模型是否能够正确介绍某位知乎答主，或者在其他上下文中提到某位知乎答主？</p><p>例如，让 gemini-3.1-pro-preview 介绍一下 <a class=\"member_mention\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/eb67c87bde5ed3b991f942e7d4b81838\" data-hash=\"eb67c87bde5ed3b991f942e7d4b81838\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$eb67c87bde5ed3b991f942e7d4b81838\">@赵泠</a>，可以得到一个像模像样的结果：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-77e4af50b2a6c303bd636bbe0636fe13_1440w.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1488\" data-rawheight=\"2034\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1488\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-77e4af50b2a6c303bd636bbe0636fe13_r.jpg\"/></figure><p>类似的例子还有 <a class=\"member_mention\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/22adc602755babbe0e486806a83967e8\" data-hash=\"22adc602755babbe0e486806a83967e8\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$22adc602755babbe0e486806a83967e8\">@马前卒official</a> ：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f9e6100fc71235d8c645f71479f2147a_1440w.jpg\" data-rawwidth=\"1488\" data-rawheight=\"2040\" data-size=\"normal\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1488\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f9e6100fc71235d8c645f71479f2147a_r.jpg\"/></figure>",
